␀␀XTENSION= 'BINTABLE'           / binary table extension                         BITPIX  =                    8 / 8-bit bytes                                    NAXIS   =                    2 / 2-dimensional binary table                     NAXIS1  =                  244 / width of table in bytes                        NAXIS2  =                    5 / number of rows in table                        PCOUNT  =                    0 / size of special data area                      GCOUNT  =                    1 / one data group (required keyword)              TFIELDS =                    4 / number of fields in each row                   TTYPE1  = 'CFRR    '           / Count-to-Framerate Ratio                       TFORM1  = 'E       '           / format of field                                TTYPE2  = 'RMIN    '           / raw x coordinate                               TFORM2  = '20E     '           / format of field                                TTYPE3  = 'RMAX    '           / raw y coordinate                               TFORM3  = '20E     '           / format of field                                TTYPE4  = 'INTENSITY'          / cumulative PSF                                 TFORM4  = '20E     '           / format of field                                EXTNAME = 'PSF-UVW1'           / The name of this table                         TUNIT1  = 'cts/frame/PSFarea'  / Units of column                                TUNIT2  = 'pixel   '           / Units of column                                TUNIT3  = 'pixel   '           / Units of column                                TUNIT4  = '        '           / Units of column                                APERTURE= 3.50000000000000E+01 / [pixel] aperture radius used in photometric calPARX0Y0 = 1.00000000000000E+00 / Parametrization coefficient of PSF(x,y)        PARX1Y0 = 0.00000000000000E+00 / Parametrization coefficient of PSF(x,y)        PARX2Y0 = 0.00000000000000E+00 / Parametrization coefficient of PSF(x,y)      